<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<style xmlns="http://purl.org/net/xbiblio/csl" class="in-text" version="1.0" demote-non-dropping-particle="sort-only" page-range-format="expanded" default-locale="en-US">
  <info>
    <title>Slide Citation Compact (EN)</title>
    <title-short>Slide Compact EN</title-short>
    <id>https://github.com/KotaYoneda/csl-styles/misc/slide-compact/slide-compact-en</id>
    <link href="https://github.com/KotaYoneda/csl-styles/misc/slide-compact/slide-compact-en" rel="self"/>
    <contributor>
      <name>Kota Yoneda</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/KotaYoneda</uri>
    </contributor>
    <summary>スライド用の簡潔な出典表記（英語文献用）。筆頭著者＋et al.、略誌名、年;巻:ページ。タイトル・DOI・URLなし。例: Tanaka K, et al. Nat Med. 2023;29:123–130.</summary>
    <category citation-format="numeric"/>
    <category field="generic-base"/>
    <updated>2026-11-13T00:00:00+09:00</updated>
    <rights license="http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/">This work is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 License</rights>
  </info>
  <locale xml:lang="en">
    <terms>
      <term name="et-al">et al.</term>
    </terms>
  </locale>

  <!-- 著者: Tanaka K / Tanaka K, et al. -->
  <macro name="author">
    <names variable="author">
      <name name-as-sort-order="all" sort-separator=" " initialize-with="" delimiter=", " delimiter-precedes-et-al="always" et-al-min="2" et-al-use-first="1"/>
      <substitute>
        <names variable="editor"/>
        <text variable="publisher"/>
      </substitute>
    </names>
  </macro>

  <!-- 掲載誌（略称優先、ピリオド除去）。書籍などは出版社 -->
  <macro name="source">
    <choose>
      <if variable="container-title">
        <text variable="container-title" form="short" strip-periods="true"/>
      </if>
      <else>
        <text variable="publisher"/>
      </else>
    </choose>
  </macro>

  <!-- 2023;29:123–130 -->
  <macro name="year-volume-page">
    <group>
      <date variable="issued">
        <date-part name="year"/>
      </date>
      <choose>
        <if variable="volume">
          <text variable="volume" prefix=";"/>
          <text variable="page" prefix=":"/>
        </if>
        <else-if variable="page">
          <text variable="page" prefix=":"/>
        </else-if>
      </choose>
    </group>
  </macro>

  <macro name="entry">
    <group delimiter=". " suffix=".">
      <text macro="author"/>
      <text macro="source"/>
      <text macro="year-volume-page"/>
    </group>
  </macro>

  <!-- 本文中の引用も同じ1行形式で出す（スライドに直接貼る用） -->
  <citation>
    <layout delimiter="; ">
      <text macro="entry"/>
    </layout>
  </citation>

  <bibliography>
    <layout>
      <text macro="entry"/>
    </layout>
  </bibliography>
</style>
